      "review_level": "full_raw_source_body_review",
      "assessment": "Full agency-domain model read. Useful finite membership checks admit exactly23 foundational agencies or those23 plus DOD, reject extra record fields, reject duplicate YAML keys and require unique declared artifact producers. These are local schema/routing policies, not real-world authority or capability proof. Nested agencies remain mutable as documented, so construction checks are not perpetual invariants. route_produced_artifact directly interpolates filename and artifact class without traversal/canonical-path validation; an admitted class plus ../../ filename can escape the intended logical folder. Legacy routing rejects dot/colon/backslash components but contains a shadowed duplicate _adversary dictionary key and a separate overriding special case. DOD fallback records are synthesized outside the stored producer census. No YAML loader or filesystem-loading method executed.",
