      "review_level": "full_raw_source_body_review",
      "assessment": "Digest checks exact string type, normalizes whitespace/case and validates length/alphabet according to kind. Git accepts40/64 hex characters; signature accepts every length64..128 including odd lengths that bytes.fromhex cannot decode. Kind itself is not checked to be DigestKind. Shape validation does not compute a digest, authenticate a signature, bind an algorithm to supplied bytes or enforce fixed signature width. Equality/hash consistently include exact runtime type and kind.",
