      ],
      "review_level": "full_raw_source_body_review",
      "assessment": "MutationItem validates path and action-dependent digest shapes, but non-string/non-enum action objects pass through and can skip every digest requirement. Validated digests are discarded rather than stored normalized; original uppercase/whitespace spellings remain in the record. Unused fields are unrestricted, including old digest for CREATE and new/content for DELETE. This creates canonical-encoding and closed-schema gaps before any Git effect.",
      "actual_execution_status": "Source review only; no original module, provider, network or native execution. Independent controls, if added, are recorded separately.",
