      ],
      "review_level": "full_raw_source_body_review",
      "assessment": "ApplicationReceipt validates several role-specific identifiers/digest shapes and checks a NUL-delimited self-digest over declared Git states/decision/token/fence/time/effect. This is internal consistency, not proof that Git changed or a human authorized it. authority_effect is hashed but never required to be None; non-int fence inputs bypass FenceToken conversion and int() can silently coerce them. Receipt ID is excluded from the digest and controls equality, so ID uniqueness needs an external registry. These constructor boundaries remain distinct from authenticated execution.",
