        ]
      ],
      "review_level": "full_raw_source_body_review",
      "assessment": "All895 lines of strict bootstrap owner read. Strong reusable mechanism: closed frozen schemas, exact bool/int authority-null fields, normalized scalar Unicode, explicit path/identifier alphabets, sorted unique finite controls, complete coverage of declared missing automation, exact15 T0 IDs, domain-separated canonical JSON hashes, duplicate/float/nonfinite refusal and exact re-encoding equality. Expiry uses an injected UTC clock and is explicitly separate from parsing. Binding verifies supplied policy/T0/schema/evidence bytes plus expected repository/base/actor labels; labels and URI digests do not authenticate real actors or prove controls effective. Parsing bounds bytes/depth/nodes, but bCR scanning precedes byte-size rejection, object serialization materializes before size rejection, and extremely long int tokens can raise host ValueError outside the typed catch. No bootstrap script, validator model or external effect executed.",
      "actual_execution_status": "Source review only; no original module, provider, network or native execution. Independent controls, if added, are recorded separately.",
