      "review_level": "full_raw_source_body_review",
      "assessment": "Candidate binding hashes repository, PR, base/head/merge base, tree/blob map, path-set, policy and evaluator identities, rederiving on construction and comparison; useful stale-review detection. MappingProxyType protects a copied outer dictionary only, despite deep-copy wording: nested wrong-type values remain mutable because runtime value types are not validated. Bool PR, empty string tree and unvalidated digest-shaped labels are admitted. A self-consistent user-created binding is not authenticated Git state, and path-set alone correctly never permits continuity. No Git access occurred.",
