      "review_level": "full_raw_source_body_review",
      "assessment": "CAS license issuer now includes a random nonce by default, improving uniqueness over fixed epoch/candidate hashes. Validation checks only expiry comparison and head equality; it does not rederive license_id, validate candidate identity, enforce single use, check issuance time or perform an atomic Git CAS. NaN expiry/current values bypass >=, and unconstrained constructors permit fabricated consistent-looking records. TTL is not included in license ID. This is a local precondition token, not an execution capability by itself; secrets generator and Git were not invoked.",
