      ],
      "review_level": "full_raw_source_body_review",
      "assessment": "Full legacy council bridge read. Correctly refuses to verify configured decisions and marks arithmetic as advisory; optional signature callback is not an authentication default. It validates vote types/unique member labels, participation bounds and optional exact electorate, then compares AYE share over all participating votes including abstentions. Fraction thresholds are exact; float thresholds intentionally retain historical float comparisons. Tally maps RATIFIED to APPROVED only in a legacy record. Distinct labels and optional signatures do not prove independent voters; no clock/verifier invoked.",
      "actual_execution_status": "Source review only; no original module, provider, network or native execution. Independent controls, if added, are recorded separately.",
