      "review_level": "full_raw_source_body_review",
      "assessment": "Direct census distinguishes adapter failure/malformed payload from zero results and refuses search-only results as terminal evidence. It delegates filtering/pagination/completeness to supplied fetch ports, coercing PR numbers with int and not validating uniqueness or state. observation.setdefault can retain a conflicting caller-supplied repository label. Search payload conversion is outside the guarded failure block. No adapter was called; an empty direct response alone cannot establish remote completeness without the port contract.",
