      "assessment": "EventTape constructs sequential payload/entry hashes and replay rechecks integrity, exact index and previous hash from a zero genesis. Useful local hash-chain consistency; without a trusted external terminal hash it cannot detect replacing/recomputing the whole chain or truncating a valid prefix. No state-machine transition, unique event ID or timestamp monotonicity rule is checked. Default now is ambient clock behavior, not used here.",
