      "review_level": "full_raw_source_body_review",
      "assessment": "Full tape-entry body reread after one truncated display. Recursively freezes JSON containers and rejects unsupported/nonfinite values, then verifies payload hash and a framed entry hash. It does not enforce exact-int seq, mapping-only payload root, closed transition vocabulary or hex previous hash beyond length. Replay integrity recomputes hashes but is not authentication; self-consistent alternative entries remain possible. Finite floats and raw timestamp spelling make this its own serialization profile, distinct from strict bootstrap canonical JSON.",
