        ]
      ],
      "review_level": "full_raw_source_body_review",
      "assessment": "Exact-blob reconciliation computes all path keys, delegates each decision, refuses unresolved/unhandled decisions, handles deletions explicitly and marks output NOT_RERUN_AFTER_RECONCILIATION. This is a finite map merge, not a Git tree build or content verification. Returned path_blobs is a mutable dict under a frozen wrapper and stored digest is not subsequently rechecked. Ownership/conflict semantics depend on the separately read classifier.",
