      "assessment": "parse_blob_spec refuses every input, intentionally eliminating combined rev:path input. safe_blob_read accepts separate string-coerced values but only rejects colon; empty, control, traversal and arbitrary revision labels remain unchecked. It returns a request, does not read committed bytes or authenticate the target Git object.",
