      "review_level": "full_raw_source_body_review",
      "assessment": "Identity links require exact reference/sentinel types, slot domains, future decision/application sentinels and authority None. Canonical ASCII JSON uses exact closed keys, duplicate/number refusal,4096-byte input ceiling, reserialization equality and domain-separated hashes with constant-time digest comparison. However evidence-before-execution is enforced only by with_evidence; constructor/parser allow a real evidence ref alongside execution NOT_YET_CREATED. Digest equality checks supplied bytes against a trusted expectation only if the caller authenticates that expectation. No private identity material accessed.",
