      "review_level": "full_raw_source_body_review",
      "assessment": "Disposal checks ancestor declaration or a typed cherry receipt with zero exit, bound argv heads and nonempty +/- hex-line grammar; any plus blocks ordinary disposal. Trailing argv after the two head fields is accepted, so receipt scope is not an exact fixed command contract. Typed caller-created records do not authenticate subprocess output. force=True bypasses failed/missing evidence with a HUMAN_ONLY label but no human-auth check in this function. No deletion or Git command was run.",
